{"reviews":[{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-0","r":1.0,"t":"Glue was dried out","x":"Wasn't pleased with this item.. the glue was completely dried out.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-1","r":5.0,"t":"Nice. Thick!!","x":"I like the length. Great for going out. Comes with the applicator and glue. Some people may not like the spaces within the lash but I don\u2019t mind.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-2","r":4.0,"t":"Very, very long and curly","x":"So these are a LOT longer than I expected and they look pretty cartoonish. But they are well constructed and applied easily. I did trim the sides down as they were too wide for my eye.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-3","r":5.0,"t":"Buy them!","x":"Ignore my brows it's WAY past due time to have them done. This was my VERY first time EVER applying false lashes on myself and would definitely give 10/10. Application process is easy, simple & quick. The glue is amazing, they stayed on allday until I removed them myself. Would buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-4","r":2.0,"t":"Irresponsable","x":"Que trastreria tienen sus empleado de dejar los art\u00edculos avajo y no llevarlo directamente al apartamento yo soy una compradora fija con ustedes y nunca hab\u00eda pasado esto van 2 beses que asen lo mismo traten de resolver eso porque algo que seme pierda melo tienen que pagar","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-5","r":5.0,"t":"Bang for your buck.","x":"These are the first lashes I've ever had and the first time I've applied them. They seem simple enough. They stayed on all day, even outdoors.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-6","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect For a Wedding!","x":"I bought these for a bridal party, including the bride, and they were PERFECT! The pictures came out beautifully \u2764\ufe0f Highly recommended!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-7","r":5.0,"t":"Exactly what I wanted!","x":"These were exactly the level of extra I wanted to be at one of my best friends\u2019 wedding. \ud83d\udcaf  Easy to apply, perfect glue!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-8","r":4.0,"t":"Amazing Lashes!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:df8ca2516ad23e0867f49ed8b9c33390]] These are amazing! I use them for nearly every single eye look I do, and I absolutely adore them. They\u2019re nice and fluffy with the right amount of flare to make them dramatic. Only downside is I got the wrong eyelashes the second time I ordered, so make sure you contact the seller to verify what lashes you ordered, I guess?","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-9","r":5.0,"t":"BOMB","x":"[[VIDEOID:10ae7df7a398012fb59452131528f62f]] These lashes are everything I love in a pair of falsies \u2763 Perfect for a natural look or a soft glam look! Also wispy which I adore cuz the lashes arent all flat looking they have volume \ud83d\udc96 they've gained a forever customer here!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-10","r":5.0,"t":"Ya descubri que estas pesta\u00f1as ban con toda medida de ojos. Grandes, medianos y peque\u00f1os","x":"Y por el precio es una buena invercion Y ademas de lo lindas qur se miran ya puestas no se ciente que traigas pesta\u00f1as postisas. Porque su peso es ligero tambien son muy faciles de usar,me gustaron mucho las volbere ha encargar otra ves. Gracias","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-11","r":4.0,"t":"The glue was dried out and not useable","x":"The lashes look great, the glue not so much. I have never put fake lashes on myself so I was excited to try. When I went to apply the glue it was all dried out. I\u2019ll keep the lashes because they are pretty but I\u2019ll buy glue elsewhere.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-12","r":5.0,"t":"Gorgeous Faux Lashes!!!","x":"Gorgeous lashes! Super long, full (but still light weight), and easy to apply! The glue it came with worked very well! Also comes with a lashes applicator so the whole package is absolutely a great value for the price!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-13","r":1.0,"t":"Do not buy if you want your eyelashes ripped off","x":"The glue is terrible would highly recommend getting magnetic lashes. The glue stuck my eyelashes together and wouldn\u2019t come off with anything. I had to use vasaline, soap, water, makeup remover to get any of it off!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great lashes!","x":"Amazing lashes! They feel and wear great, also the glue is very good too definitely 5 stars for the glue too, I will be definitely ordering this again and have already recommended to tons of friends!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-15","r":4.0,"t":"I like it!","x":"These lashes are super nice! But let me tell you, this is the best lash glue I have ever used. Seriously! And it\u2019s easy enough to take off that I could use it to apply lashes daily if I wanted to.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-16","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful lashes","x":"This product is great! The lash glue is the best glue I\u2019ve ever used and I\u2019m very picky about the glue. Super impressed with the lashes, they stay on great and you can apply mascara without issue.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-17","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful lashes","x":"This product is great! The lash glue is the best glue I\u2019ve ever used and I\u2019m very picky about the glue. Super impressed with the lashes, they stay on great and you can apply mascara without issue.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-18","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful lashes","x":"This product is great! The lash glue is the best glue I\u2019ve ever used and I\u2019m very picky about the glue. Super impressed with the lashes, they stay on great and you can apply mascara without issue.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-19","r":2.0,"t":"Buy glue separately","x":"The eyelashes look fantastic.  I just wish that the glue wasn't rock hard. My mistake was taking it un open to where I needed to put it on. Missed out on wearing those beauties that day.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-20","r":2.0,"t":"Way too big, very cheap looking","x":"These are way way more then I expected. They are huge on me. It looks really fake and cheap. Cartoonish lashes. My husband was trying not to laugh when I wore these lol pass","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-21","r":5.0,"t":"A+ Very Satisfied!","x":"These work great! They're perfect for any stage or even just going to the store. The glue that comes with it lasts a long time also. I will be buying more for sure. Thanks!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-22","r":5.0,"t":"AMAZING","x":"I bought these to start wearing eye lashes and they are so beautiful, light weight and perfect. Ill probably only buy these lashes . The glue is pretty great too.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-23","r":2.0,"t":"Super thick and not curled","x":"I don\u2019t recommend lol. I even tried to thin them and they\u2019re just too much. Maybe for cosplay, but... not for me. Even so, they\u2019re light and the glue works.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07XJYFZ5N-24","r":5.0,"t":"Thick lashes. Nice!","x":"Very nice, lightweight and thick lashes. I have little to no natural lashes and these are perfect to put on and not need any extra mascara. Perfect!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the lashes easy to apply and long-lasting, staying on all day.","cites":[4,6,8,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the included glue as effective and strong.","cites":[4,8,13,15]},{"text":"A recurring complaint is that the glue arrives dried out or unusable.","cites":[1,12,14]},{"text":"Reviewers describe the lashes as long, full, and lightweight, though some find them longer or wider than expected.","cites":[2,3,9,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report receiving the wrong item or delivery issues.","cites":[5,9]}]},"qa":[]}